// labelle-android package manifest. Runtime services only: no commands, no
// hooks, no convention directories yet.
//
// `.name = "android"` because the assembler derives a plugin's module alias
// as `labelle_<name>` (labelle-assembler `deps_linker.zig` /
// `build_files/build_zig.zig`), and this package's one module is
// `labelle_android` — the same name its `build.zig.zon` declares, so no
// `b.modules.put` alias is needed. Short plugin names are the convention
// (`fsm`, `spine`, `pathfinder`); the repo name stays `labelle-android`.
//
// `manifest_version = 1`: the shipping labelle-cli parses only v1 (anything
// higher is error E5 "upgrade labelle-cli"). The `android` command namespace
// (labelle-cli#406) is reserved for this package and will be declared here
// once the package-manifest contract (labelle-cli#411) lands.
.{
    .name = "android",
    .manifest_version = 1,
    .convention_dirs = .{},
}
